  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.BB.finDensity_coord | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.BB.finDensity_coord | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.BB.finDensity_coord <;> assumption)
